<title>CANADA: Alliance Comms Q3 net turns to profit.</title>
<headline>Alliance Comms Q3 net turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	 Profit	C$0.53     Loss	C$0.22</p>
<p> Net	 Profit	 6,260     Loss	 2,170</p>
<p> Revs			54,617		   43,379</p>
<p>	    9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 Profit	C$0.63   Profit	C$0.11</p>
<p> Net	 Profit	 7,215   Profit	 1,115</p>
<p> Revs		     118,134		  107,586</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Includes a dilution gain. Net of gain, third quarter net profit was C$1.24 million, or C$0.10 per share.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
